      "outputSchema": {
        "additionalProperties": true,
        "type": "object"
      },
      "description": "Autonomously apply a Direct write across campaigns/adgroups/ads/keywords/bids.\n\nAllowlisted service/method only (add/update/delete/suspend/resume/archive/\nmoderate, bids set/setAuto). Idempotent, with a post-write readback of the\naffected objects. campaigns:update also has an approval-gated path\n(direct_apply_changes) for a stricter human gate."
    },
